; ACCEPTED: the words of the command set
; (contract 6.4). Pen up
; throughout; the head draws nothing. Every
; line must be
; answered ok; the file ends at the origin,
; Idle.
M5
G90 G0 X0 Y0
G21 G17 G54 G94
; G0 and G1, spaced and not, upper and lower
; case
G0 X10 Y10
g1 x20 y10 f600
G1X20Y20
g1x10y20
; modal: bare coordinates continue the last
; motion word
X0 Y0
X5
Y5
; N, F and S words are read and ignored
N10 G1 X10 Y10 F300
N20 G1 X0 Y0 F1200 S500
; G91 on a line with a move: both take effect,
; in order
G91 G1 X10 Y10
G1 X-10
G1 Y-10
G90
; G17 G21 G54 G94: accepted, no effect
G17
G21
G54
G94
G21 G54 G94 G17 G90
; a line with only tolerated words (Candle
; sends S alone)
S100
F600
N30
; an empty line is answered ok

   
